<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, maximum-scale=1.0">
<title>플로릭스 스튜디오 · 빠른 작성 (v10 안전 발행)</title>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Noto+Sans+KR:wght@400;500;600;700;800;900&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/js-yaml@4.1.0/dist/js-yaml.min.js"></script>
<style>
*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0}
body{font-family:'Noto Sans KR',sans-serif;background:#FAFAF8;color:#1A1A1A;min-height:100vh;-webkit-tap-highlight-color:transparent}
.container{max-width:1100px;margin:0 auto;padding:20px;padding-bottom:140px}
.header{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;padding:14px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #E5E5E0;margin-bottom:24px;position:sticky;top:0;background:#FAFAF8;z-index:90;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px}
.header h1{font-size:20px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-0.02em}
.header-actions{display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap}
.save-indicator{font-size:11px;color:#888;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;margin-right:8px}
.save-indicator .dot{width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:50%;background:#CCC;transition:background 0.3s}
.save-indicator.changed .dot{background:#E29A4A}
.save-indicator.saved .dot{background:#7BAE5C}
.save-indicator.error .dot{background:#C62828}
.btn{padding:9px 16px;border:none;border-radius:6px;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;cursor:pointer;transition:all .15s;font-family:inherit;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;white-space:nowrap}
.btn-primary{background:#1A1A1A;color:#FAFAF8}
.btn-primary:hover:not(:disabled){background:#B8956A}
.btn-primary:disabled{opacity:.4;cursor:not-allowed}
.btn-secondary{background:transparent;color:#666;border:1px solid #E5E5E0}
.btn-secondary:hover{background:#F0F0EB}
.btn-edit{background:#FFF3CD;color:#856404;border:1px solid #FFE69C}
.btn-edit:hover{background:#FFE69C}
.btn-ghost{background:transparent;color:#666;border:1px dashed #D5D5D0;padding:11px 18px;width:100%;font-size:13px;justify-content:center}
.btn-ghost:hover{border-color:#B8956A;color:#B8956A;background:#FFF8F0}
.editing-banner{background:linear-gradient(90deg,#FFF3CD 0%,#FFE69C 100%);padding:14px 18px;border-radius:10px;margin-bottom:20px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px;border:1px solid #FFD966}
.editing-banner .editing-info{font-size:13px;color:#664D00}
.editing-banner .editing-info strong{display:block;font-size:15px;color:#1A1A1A;margin-top:2px}
.editing-banner button{background:white;border:1px solid #FFD966;color:#664D00;padding:6px 14px;border-radius:5px;font-size:12px;cursor:pointer;font-family:inherit;font-weight:600}
.editing-banner button:hover{background:#FFE69C}
.draft-banner{background:#FFF8E1;border:1px solid #FFE69C;padding:14px 18px;border-radius:10px;margin-bottom:20px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px}
.draft-banner .info{font-size:13px;color:#664D00}
.draft-actions{display:flex;gap:8px}
.draft-actions button{background:white;border:1px solid #E5E5E0;padding:6px 12px;border-radius:5px;font-size:12px;cursor:pointer;font-family:inherit}
.draft-actions button.primary{background:#1A1A1A;color:white;border-color:#1A1A1A}
.meta{background:white;padding:20px;border-radius:10px;margin-bottom:20px;border:1px solid #E5E5E0}
.meta-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:14px}
.field{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:5px}
.field label{font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:#666;letter-spacing:.05em;text-transform:uppercase}
.field input,.field select{padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E5E0;border-radius:6px;font-size:14px;font-family:inherit;background:#FAFAF8}
.field input:focus,.field select:focus{outline:none;border-color:#B8956A;background:white}
.dropzone{border:2px dashed #D5D5D0;border-radius:12px;padding:28px 20px;text-align:center;background:white;cursor:pointer;transition:all .2s;margin-bottom:16px}
.dropzone:hover,.dropzone.dragging{border-color:#B8956A;background:#FFF8F0}
.dropzone-icon{font-size:32px;margin-bottom:6px}
.dropzone p{font-size:13px;color:#666}
.dropzone strong{color:#1A1A1A;font-weight:700}
.status{padding:13px 16px;border-radius:8px;margin-bottom:14px;font-size:13px;display:none;line-height:1.5}
.status.show{display:block}
.status.info{background:#E8F0FE;color:#1A56DB}
.status.success{background:#E8F5E9;color:#2E7D32}
.status.error{background:#FEE;color:#C62828}
.status.warning{background:#FFF3CD;color:#856404}
.add-bar{display:flex;gap:8px;margin-bottom:20px}
.add-bar button{flex:1}
.blocks{min-height:80px}
.empty{text-align:center;padding:40px 20px;color:#999;font-size:13px;line-height:1.7}
.empty kbd{background:#F0F0EB;border:1px solid #D5D5D0;border-radius:3px;padding:1px 6px;font-size:11px;font-family:monospace}
.block{background:white;border:1px solid #E5E5E0;border-radius:10px;margin-bottom:10px;overflow:hidden;transition:all .15s}
.block:hover{border-color:#B8956A}
.block-header{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;padding:7px 12px;background:#FAFAF8;border-bottom:1px solid #F0F0EB;font-size:11px;color:#666}
.block-type{font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.04em;text-transform:uppercase}
.block-actions{display:flex;gap:5px}
.icon-btn{background:white;border:1px solid #E5E5E0;border-radius:4px;min-width:32px;min-height:32px;cursor:pointer;font-size:13px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;transition:all .12s;padding:0 6px;font-family:inherit}
.icon-btn:hover:not(:disabled){border-color:#B8956A;color:#B8956A}
.icon-btn:disabled{opacity:.3;cursor:not-allowed}
.icon-btn.star-btn{font-size:14px}
.icon-btn.star-btn.active{background:#FFF8E1;border-color:#E29A4A;color:#E29A4A}
.text-toolbar{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:3px;padding:6px;background:#F8F8F4;border-bottom:1px solid #F0F0EB;overflow-x:auto}
.tool-btn{background:white;border:1px solid #E5E5E0;border-radius:4px;padding:4px 9px;cursor:pointer;font-size:12px;font-family:inherit;transition:all .1s;min-width:32px;min-height:30px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center}
.tool-btn:hover{border-color:#B8956A}
.tool-btn.active{background:#1A1A1A;color:white}
.tool-divider{width:1px;background:#E5E5E0;margin:0 3px;flex-shrink:0}
.color-btn{width:28px;padding:0!important;border-radius:4px}
.text-content{padding:14px 16px;min-height:90px;outline:none;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;word-break:break-word}
.text-content:empty:before{content:attr(data-placeholder);color:#BBB}
.image-block-content{position:relative}
.image-preview{width:100%;max-height:420px;object-fit:contain;display:block;background:#1A1A1A}
.thumb-badge{position:absolute;top:10px;left:10px;background:#E29A4A;color:white;padding:5px 11px;border-radius:5px;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.04em;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,.15);z-index:1}
.image-meta{padding:8px 14px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;font-size:11px;color:#888;background:#FAFAF8;gap:10px}
.image-meta .filename{overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;white-space:nowrap;flex:1}
.image-meta .status-text{flex-shrink:0}
.caption-input{width:100%;padding:9px 14px;border:none;border-top:1px solid #F0F0EB;font-size:12px;font-family:inherit;background:white}
.caption-input:focus{outline:none;background:#FFF8F0}
.upload-progress{height:3px;background:#E5E5E0;overflow:hidden}
.upload-progress-bar{height:100%;background:#B8956A;transition:width .3s;width:0%}
.bottom-bar{position:fixed;bottom:0;left:0;right:0;background:white;border-top:1px solid #E5E5E0;padding:10px 18px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;z-index:50;box-shadow:0 -4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,.04);gap:10px}
.bottom-info{font-size:12px;color:#666}
.bottom-info strong{color:#1A1A1A}
.fab{position:fixed;bottom:74px;right:18px;width:54px;height:54px;border-radius:50%;background:#1A1A1A;color:white;border:none;font-size:24px;cursor:pointer;box-shadow:0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,.18);z-index:60;transition:all .2s}
.fab:hover{background:#B8956A;transform:scale(1.05)}
.fab.open{transform:rotate(45deg)}
.fab-menu{position:fixed;bottom:138px;right:18px;display:none;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;z-index:60}
.fab-menu.show{display:flex}
.fab-menu button{background:white;border:1px solid #E5E5E0;padding:10px 16px;border-radius:8px;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;cursor:pointer;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,.08);font-family:inherit;white-space:nowrap;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px}
.fab-menu button:hover{border-color:#B8956A;color:#B8956A}
.modal-bg{position:fixed;inset:0;background:rgba(0,0,0,.5);display:none;align-items:center;justify-content:center;z-index:1000;padding:16px}
.modal-bg.show{display:flex}
.modal{background:white;border-radius:12px;max-width:720px;width:100%;max-height:85vh;display:flex;flex-direction:column;overflow:hidden}
.modal-header{padding:18px 22px;border-bottom:1px solid #E5E5E0;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center}
.modal-header h2{font-size:17px;font-weight:700}
.modal-close{background:none;border:none;font-size:24px;cursor:pointer;color:#888;line-height:1;padding:0;width:32px;height:32px;border-radius:6px}
.modal-close:hover{background:#F0F0EB;color:#1A1A1A}
.modal-body{padding:20px 22px;overflow-y:auto;flex:1}
.modal-footer{padding:14px 22px;border-top:1px solid #E5E5E0;display:flex;justify-content:flex-end;gap:8px;background:#FAFAF8}
.works-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(180px,1fr));gap:14px}
.work-card{border:1px solid #E5E5E0;border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden;cursor:pointer;transition:all .15s;background:white}
.work-card:hover{border-color:#B8956A;transform:translateY(-2px);box-shadow:0 4px 12px rgba(0,0,0,.08)}
.work-card-thumb{aspect-ratio:4/3;background:#F0F0EB;background-size:cover;background-position:center;position:relative}
.work-card-info{padding:10px 12px}
.work-card-title{font-size:13px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.4;margin-bottom:4px;display:-webkit-box;-webkit-line-clamp:2;-webkit-box-orient:vertical;overflow:hidden}
.work-card-meta{font-size:11px;color:#888}
.publish-log{font-family:'JetBrains Mono','Consolas',monospace;font-size:12px;background:#1A1A1A;color:#7BAE5C;padding:14px;border-radius:6px;max-height:340px;overflow-y:auto;white-space:pre-wrap;word-break:break-all;line-height:1.55}
.publish-log .err{color:#FF6B6B}
.publish-log .warn{color:#FFD93D}
.publish-log .ok{color:#7BAE5C}
.publish-log .info{color:#8FB8FF}
.emoji-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(8,1fr);gap:4px;max-width:300px}
.emoji-grid button{background:white;border:1px solid #E5E5E0;padding:8px;font-size:18px;cursor:pointer;border-radius:5px;font-family:inherit}
.emoji-grid button:hover{background:#FFF8F0;border-color:#B8956A}
.login-card{background:white;padding:40px 28px;border-radius:12px;text-align:center;border:1px solid #E5E5E0;max-width:440px;margin:60px auto}
.login-card h2{font-size:19px;margin-bottom:10px}
.login-card p{color:#666;margin-bottom:22px;font-size:13px;line-height:1.6}
.thumb-section{margin-top:18px;padding-top:18px;border-top:1px dashed #E5E5E0}
.thumb-section>label{font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:#666;letter-spacing:.05em;text-transform:uppercase;display:block;margin-bottom:8px}
.thumb-section .hint{font-size:11px;color:#999;margin-bottom:10px}
.thumb-box{position:relative;aspect-ratio:4/5;max-width:240px;background:#FAFAF8;border:2px dashed #D5D5D0;border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden;cursor:pointer;transition:all .15s}
.thumb-box:hover{border-color:#B8956A;background:#FFF8F0}
.thumb-box.has-image{border-style:solid;border-color:#E29A4A;background:#1A1A1A}
.thumb-empty{position:absolute;inset:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;text-align:center;padding:14px}
.thumb-empty .icon{font-size:36px;margin-bottom:6px;opacity:.4}
.thumb-empty p{font-size:12px;color:#888;margin-bottom:10px;line-height:1.5}
.thumb-empty .pick-btn{background:white;border:1px solid #B8956A;color:#B8956A;padding:6px 14px;border-radius:5px;font-size:12px;cursor:pointer;font-family:inherit;font-weight:700}
.thumb-img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;display:block}
.thumb-actions{position:absolute;bottom:8px;right:8px;display:flex;gap:6px}
.thumb-actions button{background:rgba(0,0,0,.7);color:white;border:none;padding:5px 11px;border-radius:4px;font-size:11px;cursor:pointer;font-family:inherit;font-weight:600;backdrop-filter:blur(8px)}
.thumb-actions button:hover{background:rgba(0,0,0,.9)}
.thumb-actions .del{background:rgba(198,40,40,.85)}
.thumb-actions .del:hover{background:rgba(198,40,40,1)}
.thumb-options{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(110px,1fr));gap:10px}
.thumb-option{position:relative;aspect-ratio:1;background:#F0F0EB;border:2px solid transparent;border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden;cursor:pointer;transition:all .15s}
.thumb-option:hover{border-color:#B8956A;transform:translateY(-2px)}
.thumb-option.selected{border-color:#E29A4A;box-shadow:0 0 0 3px rgba(226,154,74,.2)}
.thumb-option img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;display:block}
.thumb-option-current{position:absolute;top:5px;left:5px;background:#E29A4A;color:white;padding:3px 7px;border-radius:4px;font-size:10px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.04em}
.thumb-modal-tabs{display:flex;gap:6px;margin-bottom:14px;border-bottom:1px solid #E5E5E0;padding-bottom:0}
.thumb-modal-tabs button{background:transparent;border:none;padding:9px 16px;font-size:13px;cursor:pointer;font-family:inherit;font-weight:600;color:#888;border-bottom:2px solid transparent;margin-bottom:-1px}
.thumb-modal-tabs button.active{color:#1A1A1A;border-bottom-color:#1A1A1A}
.upload-thumb-zone{border:2px dashed #D5D5D0;border-radius:10px;padding:36px 20px;text-align:center;background:#FAFAF8;cursor:pointer;transition:all .2s}
.upload-thumb-zone:hover{border-color:#B8956A;background:#FFF8F0}
.upload-thumb-zone .icon{font-size:40px;margin-bottom:8px;opacity:.5}
.upload-thumb-zone p{font-size:13px;color:#666;margin-bottom:4px}
.upload-thumb-zone .small{font-size:11px;color:#999}
.verify-result{margin-top:12px;padding:12px;border-radius:6px;font-size:12px;font-family:'JetBrains Mono','Consolas',monospace}
.verify-result.ok{background:#E8F5E9;color:#2E7D32;border:1px solid #A5D6A7}
.verify-result.fail{background:#FEE;color:#C62828;border:1px solid #FFCDD2}
@media (max-width:768px){
  .container{padding:14px;padding-bottom:140px}
  .header{padding:10px 0}
  .header h1{font-size:17px}
  .save-indicator{display:none}
  .meta-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}
  .add-bar{flex-direction:column}
  .text-content{font-size:16px}
  .field input,.field select{font-size:16px}
  .image-preview{max-height:300px}
  .bottom-bar{padding:8px 14px}
  .fab{width:48px;height:48px;font-size:22px;bottom:70px;right:14px}
  .fab-menu{bottom:124px;right:14px}
  .works-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(140px,1fr))}
}
@media (max-width:380px){
  .header h1{font-size:15px}
  .header-actions{gap:6px;width:100%}
  .btn{padding:8px 11px;font-size:12px}
}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="container">
  <div class="header">
    <h1>빠른 작성 · 시공 사례 <span style="font-size:11px;color:#999;font-weight:500">v10 안전 발행</span></h1>
    <div class="header-actions">
      <div class="save-indicator" id="saveInd"><span class="dot"></span><span class="text">준비됨</span></div>
      <button class="btn btn-edit" id="loadBtn">✏️ 글 불러오기</button>
      <a href="/admin/" class="btn btn-secondary">기존 CMS</a>
      <button class="btn btn-primary" id="pubBtn" disabled>발행</button>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div id="loginGate" class="login-card" style="display:none">
    <h2>로그인이 필요합니다</h2>
    <p>먼저 기존 CMS에 로그인한 뒤 이 페이지로 돌아오세요.</p>
    <a href="/admin/" class="btn btn-primary">CMS로 이동해서 로그인</a>
  </div>

  <div id="editor" style="display:none">
    <div id="status" class="status"></div>
    <div id="tokenStatus" class="status"></div>

    <div id="draftBanner" class="draft-banner" style="display:none">
      <div class="info">📝 이전에 작성하던 글이 있어요. 이어서 작성할까요?</div>
      <div class="draft-actions">
        <button class="primary" onclick="restoreDraft()">이어서 작성</button>
        <button onclick="discardDraft()">새로 시작</button>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div id="editingBanner" class="editing-banner" style="display:none">
      <div class="editing-info">
        ✏️ 수정 모드 · 발행하면 기존 글이 덮어쓰기 됩니다
        <strong id="editingTitle"></strong>
      </div>
      <button onclick="cancelEditing()">수정 취소 (새 글 작성)</button>
    </div>

    <div class="meta">
      <div class="meta-grid">
        <div class="field"><label>제목 *</label><input id="title" placeholder="예: 흐칵 파출소 도끼다시 폴리싱"></div>
        <div class="field"><label>지역 *</label><input id="location" placeholder="예: 서울"></div>
        <div class="field"><label>공간 종류</label>
          <select id="category">
            <option value="주거">주거</option>
            <option value="카페">카페</option>
            <option value="상업공간">상업공간</option>
            <option value="사무공간">사무공간</option>
            <option value="기타">기타</option>
          </select>
        </div>
        <div class="field"><label>시공일 *</label><input type="date" id="date"></div>
        <div class="field"><label>면적 (㎡, 선택)</label><input type="number" id="area" placeholder="예: 48"></div>
        <div class="field"><label>시공 소요시간</label><input id="duration" value="1일 완공"></div>
        <div class="field" style="grid-column:1/-1"><label>사용 컬러/규사 (선택)</label><input id="specs" placeholder="예: 베이지 톤 / 1500방 폴리싱"></div>
      </div>
      
      <div class="thumb-section">
        <label>대표 사진 (메인 카드 노출)</label>
        <p class="hint">시공사례 목록과 메인 페이지 카드에 표시되는 사진이에요</p>
        <div class="thumb-box" id="thumbBox" onclick="openThumbModal()">
          <div class="thumb-empty">
            <div class="icon">📷</div>
            <p>대표 사진을 선택하세요</p>
            <button class="pick-btn" onclick="event.stopPropagation();openThumbModal()">사진 선택</button>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="dropzone" id="dropzone">
      <div class="dropzone-icon">📷</div>
      <p><strong>여기에 사진을 드래그</strong>하거나 클릭해서 선택</p>
      <p style="margin-top:5px;font-size:11px">한 번에 여러 장 가능 · 자동으로 순서대로 추가</p>
      <input type="file" id="fileInput" multiple accept="image/*" style="display:none">
    </div>

    <div class="add-bar">
      <button class="btn-ghost" onclick="addTextBlock()">＋ 텍스트 추가</button>
      <button class="btn-ghost" onclick="document.getElementById('fileInput').click()">＋ 사진 추가</button>
    </div>

    <div class="blocks" id="blocks">
      <div class="empty">
        오른쪽 아래 <kbd>＋</kbd> 버튼 또는 위 영역에서 시작하세요.<br>
        <span style="font-size:11px;color:#BBB;display:inline-block;margin-top:8px">단축키: <kbd>Ctrl+Shift+T</kbd> 텍스트 · <kbd>Ctrl+Shift+I</kbd> 사진 · <kbd>Ctrl+S</kbd> 저장</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<button class="fab" id="fab" style="display:none">＋</button>
<div class="fab-menu" id="fabMenu">
  <button onclick="addTextBlock();toggleFab()">📝 텍스트 추가</button>
